# Session scratch + build-output copies (regenerable / handoff-only)
Scratch-handoff/
dist-screenshot/
# Vitest browser-mode writes a PNG here when a test FAILS (`screenshotFailures`
# defaults to true). These are failure debris, not snapshot baselines: nothing
# in the repo calls `toMatchScreenshot`, so no test ever compares against them.
# The old line pinned `src/lib/__tests__/__screenshots__/`, a path vitest never
# writes to, while the four directories it does write to went untracked and two
# stale PNGs sat committed under `src/__tests__/__screenshots__/` — named for
# tests that no longer exist (backlog #1042).
**/__screenshots__/
review/*.png
review/audit-newteammate/
review/a11y-deep/
review/debox-audit-*/
review/n1-mobile-audit-*/
review/claude-design-*/
review/claude-design-*.zip
review/interactions-*/
review/audit-detail/
review/massive-audit/
review/gh-issues/
review/post-track-a-*/
review/post-*-*/
review/mobile-sweep-*/

